&lt;h3 class="smt_head6" style="padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(生産、受注及び販売の状況)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:8.9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18.0pt;"&gt;(1)　生産実績&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:20.2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;当連結会計年度における生産実績をセグメントごとに示すと、次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:359.2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-size:9.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="text-align:left;margin-left:0.1pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="align_left" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:467.9pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:233.9pt;min-width:233.9pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:138.9pt;min-width:138.9pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:95.1pt;min-width:95.1pt;"/&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:17pt;min-height:17pt;"&gt;
