  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:45pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;(注) １. 定量的な保有効果は記載が困難であります。保有の合理性は年１回棚卸を行い、その結果を取締役会で報告することで、検証しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:45pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;font-size:11pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock>
